From downstream Tue Oct 14 00:00:00 2026
Subject: [PATCH] retry own outbound SCM_CREDENTIALS with Android IDs

The downstream change is generated from TAWC revision
64e3736699684a4fc0029e71bdfb7cc1e0884323. It retries only an outbound
SCM_CREDENTIALS record containing the process's own virtual IDs after EPERM,
substituting actual Android UID/GID in a bounded private copy. Received
credentials and unrelated control data remain unchanged.
diff --git a/tawcroot/src/syscalls_socket.c b/tawcroot/src/syscalls_socket.c
index 13deeab..7df0e4f 100644
--- a/tawcroot/src/syscalls_socket.c
+++ b/tawcroot/src/syscalls_socket.c
